at creates a vintage aesthetic which enhances the terrifying experience, featuring high-quality sounds. <u><strong>Be sure to wear headphones for the best audio experience.</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892000/extras/07fc1c0c359c292c4f61500e2db048a1.poster.avif?t=1736421588\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892000/extras/07fc1c0c359c292c4f61500e2db048a1.webm?t=1736421588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892000/extras/07fc1c0c359c292c4f61500e2db048a1.mp4?t=1736421588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>The game includes intense jumpscares and scenery. Brace yourself!</strong><br><br><u>Average time to complete the game: 70 min</u>",
